                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "That <w>jerk</w> always parks his car in the middle of the sidewalk."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Ik wil niets meer te maken hebben met die egoïstische <w>hufter</w>.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "I want nothing more to do with that selfish <w>asshole</w>."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Wat een <w>hufter</w> is die man toch om zo tegen haar te schreeuwen.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "What a <w>lout</w> that man is to shout at her like that."
                            }
